	(text "6. Conduct comms tests, when ready, populate missing cell tap RC filters \n    and cell balancing resistors to begin 12 cell testing. Undo JP3 solder. \n    Disconnect harness.\n    After this, the next steps are real module tests, cell balancing,\n    multiple modules daisy-chained, and business logic."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 99.314 167.386 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "eeb59165-1869-42be-b821-75d8d079f021")
	)
